{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your cue, line up your shot, and sink the 8 ball! <strong>8 Ball Kings</strong> is a <strong>realistic and immersive billiards game</strong> that brings the excitement of the pool hall straight to your PC. Whether you're a casual player looking for a relaxing match or a pool enthusiast aiming for perfection, <strong>this game delivers smooth gameplay, precise physics, and endless fun</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb1 <strong>Can you master every shot and become the true King of 8 Ball?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Realistic Physics &amp; Smooth Controls</strong> \u2013 Every shot feels just like real billiards.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenging Single-Player Mode</strong> \u2013 Play classic 8-ball and sharpen your skills.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Grab a friend and compete in exciting head-to-head matches.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customizable Tables &amp; Cues</strong> \u2013 Personalize your setup with different designs.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Immersive Graphics &amp; Sound</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a true-to-life pool hall atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME THE CHAMPION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break, aim, and pot your way to victory! <strong>Are you ready to prove you're the ultimate 8 Ball King?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now &amp; get ready to take your best shot!</strong> \ud83c\udfb1\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560410?t=1741173706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560410?t=1741173706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560410/b578d3316303f5100b59b953b121cdd31310315c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741173706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto